    title: "First reading of the whole cipher letter BnF fr. 15573 f. 385 (Mayenne-Forget Cipher-2, 1586)"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Burford"
        given-names: "Brett"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/BravoBravoIX/mayenne-forget-1586-cipher-reading"
  - type: webpage
    title: "French ciphers during the Reigns of Charles IX and Henry III"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Tomokiyo"
        given-names: "Satoshi"
    url: "https://cryptiana.web.fc2.com/code/henryiii.htm"
